+ * features are not supported:
+ * - Word lengths other than 8 bits
+ * - Break handling
+ * - Parity
+ * - Flow control
+ * - Modem signals (DSR, RI, etc.)
+ * On the other hand, the design is free from the baggage of the classical 8250
+ * programming model.
